[00:00] [scene:intro]
VISUAL: Creator introduces Sorceress Game Creation Suite and WizardGenie game engine.
AUDIO: 'This is the missing ingredient in your game development workflows. Everything that game devs need to create content, assets, and code all in one convenient place. AI has unlocked amazing new development tools for game devs. The'

[00:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'problem is that they\'re fragmented. They don\'t have cohesive pipelines, cohesive workflows. The raw ingredients are there, but they\'re not fast and easy, and they don\'t produce game-ready assets. And that is why I created the'

[00:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Sorceress Game Creation Suite because there\'s amazing technologies out there that are unlocking game development to people who didn\'t think they would ever be able to be able to imagine and create the games perhaps they\'ve always dreamed'

[00:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'about creating because of steep learning curves with Unreal Engine, Unity, coding, and asset creation. These are all now possible for the solo game developer. And what Sorceress does is it takes what is now possible for the solo'

[00:49] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'developer to accomplish, and it makes it convenient. Because yes, amazing new AI-powered tools are available, but it doesn\'t mean they\'re convenient. Doesn\'t mean they\'re fast and easy to use. And not only that, usually you need to jump'

[01:01] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'around across a half a dozen dozen platforms in order to access all these tools. That is where the Sorceress Game Creation Suite steps in. Let\'s take a look at the suite. The suite has become loaded with all sorts of game'

[01:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'development tools from Auto Sprite, which lets you convert an AI image into AI video, and then turn that AI video animation into a game-ready sprite sheet. We\'ve got 3D Studio, where you can generate 3D models, automatically'

[01:26] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: Sorceress Sound Studio UI is shown, detailing music, SFX, and voice generation.
AUDIO: 'rig them, and then generate animations using text-to-animation AI. Export to your favorite game engine. It\'s a super fast and easy workflow. We\'ve also got the brand new Voxel Studio, where you'

[01:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'can generate voxel characters, voxel assets, trees, rocks, characters. You can animate them. We\'ve also got a really cool procedural walk rigging system. And then we\'ve got True Pixel, where you can convert your images or'

[01:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'videos into pixel art animations and pixel art graphics. There\'s also the new sound studio where you can generate AI music, &gt;&gt; [music]'

[02:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; AI sound effects. You can generate AI text-to-speech using natural voices and you can even clone your own voice to create a lifelike AI version of your own voice. Welcome to'

[02:18] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the Sorceress Game Creation Suite. We\'ve got the Tile Set Forge where you can generate raw AI art and then detect the tiles within that art that\'s been generated and then convert it into a'

