[02:44] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'got all sorts of different AI image generation models from Nano Banana Pro, GPT Image 2.0, all the latest and the greatest. And then we\'ve got AI Video Gen. Once again, all the best models are available here from Seed Dance 2, Kling'

