VISUAL: WizardGenie Chat UI with a prompt for a 3D sci-fi shooter.
AUDIO: '3, Wan 2.7, Grok Imagine. And then we\'ve got our Material Forge where you can generate AI materials. So, you generate an AI material, run it through Material Forge, and you\'ll be able to create'

[03:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'surfaces such as glass or water or bricks or stone or whatever sort of material material that you need, export it to your favorite game engine, use it in Vibe coding environments. And then we have a very cool procedural walk 3D'

[03:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'animation system where you can automatically rig up your characters with procedural walk. This is a very cool way of creating animation because it automatically detects the surface of the environment that you\'re walking'

[03:37] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
